Add Elementary Weeks 3-10 lessons (51 new, Units 3-12)

Grammar, vocabulary, reading and writing for Present Simple plural, adverbs of
frequency, like+ing, there is/are, quantifiers, can/could, was/were, past
questions, prepositions of time, countable nouns, comparatives, superlatives,
have got, present continuous, going to, present perfect; house, town, food,
weather, clothes, collocation vocabulary; readings and writing tasks (form
filling, formal email, biography, story, formal vs informal, holiday email).
Past Simple lesson extended with spelling and irregular-verb tables.

All texts and exercises are original; the weekly report was used as a topic outline.

